      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Avatar Culling does not unload avatars entirely, nor is it designed to. It only works this way when loading a fresh instance because we delay the initial load until you see an avatar for the first time.\n\nThis is _intentional_ and will not be changed to completely unload avatars. We are however working on general improvements to this behaviour, such as disabling animators and reducing overall CPU cost for hidden avatars.\n\nThose efforts are ongoing as part of larger projects, so I will close this task with the note above.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
